ZAINAB KI TAMANNA HAI CHELUM HU BAHATTAR KA<br>
HAR SAANS KARE MATAM HAR AANKH KARE GIRYA<br>
<br>
1.Kal Zainab e Muztar Par Tufaan They Mazalim Ke<br>
Baazu Pa Badhi Rassi Majboor Thi Matam Se<br>
Us Gham Zada Bibi Ku Dena Hai Hume Pursa<br>
<br>
2.Jab Choth Ke Haram Aaye Zindan Aaziyath Se<br>
Dil Bibiou Ke Tadpe Karbal Ki Ziyarath Se<br>
Khabre Jo Nazar Aayi Ek Hashr Howa Barpa<br>
<br>
3.Shabbir Ki Turbat Par Zainab Ne Kahan Rokar<br>
Main Aayi Hu Aaye Bhai Har Ranj o Alam Sehkar<br>
Jee Bhar Ke Kabhi Tumku Main Ro Na saki Bhaiya<br>
<br>
4.Tadhpati Reh Reh Kar Bazarou Ki Zebayi<br>
Bhai Teri Zainab Par Haste They Tamashai<br>
Sar Sharm Se Balwe Me Uthaa Na Kabhi Mera<br>
<br>
5.Baazu Pa Naasha Lekar Kaise Main Watan Jaoun<br>
Jo Zulm Howe Hum Par Kis Tarah Se Batlaou<br>
Sughra Se Milo Kaise Kya Usse Kahu Bhaiya<br>
<br>
6.Akber Ka Kiya Matam Qasim Ku Kabhi Royi<br>
Abbas Ki Turbat Par Yeh Kehte Howe Doudhi<br>
Kis Kis Ka Karu Chelum Koi Na Raha Mera<br>
<br>
7.Hai Saya Figan Bibi Zainab Ki Dua Hum Par<br>
Moula Ki Zamanath Me Sab Matami Aye Manzar<br>
Badhta Hi Rahe Har Yeh Karwa Aza Ka
